WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.680
Enough

00:02.800 --> 00:04.200
Enough

00:04.680 --> 00:06.120
If you don't want to do it

00:06.200 --> 00:07.600
Then get out

00:08.160 --> 00:09.800
Go guard your sister's tomb

00:10.600 --> 00:12.000
Get out

00:13.840 --> 00:14.920
Your servant

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
Thank you for Your Majesty's grace
